      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3336,
        "name": "艾尔海森",
        "desc": "<p>须弥教令院现任书记官，有过人的智慧与才能。生活得自由自在，一般人基本找不到他。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/17/47826599/25249dd20b86c775fb35bdbbd805d9ec_8728328065423189518.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2850,
        "name": "纳西妲",
        "desc": "<p>深居净善宫的笼中之鸟，只能在梦中将世界尽收眼底。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/11/01/47826599/f29490bddc56b4a6773b6c5003bbb853_9178865138637843993.png",
