      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2674,
        "name": "旅行者（草）",
        "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65)\">从世界之外漂流而来的旅行者，被神带走血亲，自此踏上寻找七神之路。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/08/23/169177528/04f769b0b1671b5ffbbafefd7286b4b2_8705989835434741194.png",
