        "text": "<color=#ffffff>4★</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3608,
        "name": "卡维",
        "desc": "<p>须弥著名建筑设计师，对太多事物抱有过度关怀心。美学主义者，为现实所困扰。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/05/01/47826599/2270aba02b92034d7d76b4426be8f53b_3150066710540343521.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2859,
        "name": "莱依拉",
        "desc": "<p>专攻理论星相学的梨多梵谛学院学生。时常梦游，长期缺觉，饱受睡眠问题困扰。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/11/01/47826599/48a495acadaf37f12d0a7f653d85bd83_2737945499491086468.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2269,
        "name": "多莉",
        "desc": "<p>神出鬼没的旅行百货商人，最喜欢亮闪闪的摩拉。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/08/24/47826599/6539bea71efd0f839db897cfc4094362_6098603835101164577.png",
